        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>云南各地美食</title>\n  <script>\n    window.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] } };\n  </script>\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    html, body {\n      margin: 0;\n      min-height: 100%;\n    }\n    body {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: center;\n      background: #e8e8e8;\n      font-family: \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", serif;\n    }\n    .poster {\n      width: 540px;\n      min-height: 720px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      padding: 14px 14px 10px;\n      color: #111;\n      background-color: #56c6b0;\n      background-image:\n        radial-gradient(circle at 7% 18%, rgba(255,255,255,.12) 0 2px, transparent 3px),\n        radial-gradient(circle at 12% 21%, rgba(255,255,255,.08) 0 6px, transparent 7px),\n        radial-gradient(circle at 90% 27%, rgba(255,255,255,.12) 0 2px, transparent 3px),\n        radial-gradient(circle at 82% 29%, rgba(255,255,255,.08) 0 7px, transparent 8px),\n        radial-gradient(circle at 6% 72%, rgba(255,255,255,.09) 0 8px, transparent 9px),\n        radial-gradient(circle at 94% 83%, rgba(255,255,255,.10) 0 8px, transparent 9px),\n        linear-gradient(35deg, transparent 48%, rgba(255,255,255,.05) 49%, rgba(255,255,255,.05) 51%, transparent 52%);\n      background-size: 92px 88px, 105px 120px, 130px 105px, 148px 134px, 110px 120px, 145px 148px, 74px 74px;\n    }\n    .title {\n      position: relative;\n      height: 67px;\n      text-align: center;\n      font-family: \"STKaiti\", \"KaiTi\", serif;\n      font-size: 48px;\n      line-height: 58px;\n      letter-spacing: 3px;\n      font-weight: 500;\n    }\n    .title::before {\n      content: \"\";\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 84px;\n      bottom: 2px;\n      width: 347px;\n      height: 9px;\n      border-radius: 10px;\n      background: #ffde8b;\n      transform: rotate(.3deg);\n    }\n    .title::after {\n      content: \"\";\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 81px;\n      bottom: 5px;\n      width: 340px;\n      height: 6px;\n      border-radius: 10px;\n      background: #eb3e31;\n      transform: rotate(-.25deg);\n    }\n    .section {\n      margin: 0 0 8px;\n      font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"SimHei\", sans-serif;\n      font-size: 17px;\n      line-height: 1.16;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      letter-spacing: .05px;\n    }\n    .section h2 {\n      display: table;\n      margin: 0 0 1px;\n      padding: 0 4px 1px;\n      background: #fff7c5;\n      font-family: \"SimHei\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n      font-size: 24px;\n      line-height: 27px;\n      font-weight: 900;\n    }\n    .section p {\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 0;\n    }\n    .food {\n      color: #ec3b2e;\n      font-weight: 900;\n    }\n    @media (max-width: 540px) {\n      .poster { width: 100vw; min-height: 133.333vw; }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"poster\">\n    <div class=\"title\">云南各地美食</div>\n\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <h2>昆明</h2>\n      <p><span class=\"food\">小锅米线：</span>昆明，米线种类众多，首当推小锅米线，还有一种砂锅米线<br>\n      <span class=\"food\">汽锅鸡：</span>这个汤不是直接加的水，也就是说这个锅里原来只有鸡肉和佐料，一点水不加。那汤是哪来的呢？水蒸气<br>\n      <span class=\"food\">过桥米线：</span>不能算昆明小吃，应该在蒙自。连最有名的桥香园总店也是在蒙自</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <h2>大理</h2>\n      <p><span class=\"food\">饵丝：</span>比煎饼果子好吃！其实没什么可比性。可以加些菜，香肠鸡蛋什么的。酱可以选择咸的或者甜的<br>\n      <span class=\"food\">凉鸡米线：</span>将做好的白斩鸡撕成条，拌入米线里，加入梅子醋和调料，最后浇上一勺鸡子水，入口酸甜爽滑<br>\n      <span class=\"food\">乳扇：</span>能煎能炸，能烧能烤，还能卷成筒状内塞馅料。本地常吃的方法是用菜油煎黄后，撒盐或白糖食用</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <h2>丽江</h2>\n      <p><span class=\"food\">鸡豌豆凉粉：</span>豆经碾磨成粉条，灰绿色，煎炸凉拌都很入味<br>\n      <span class=\"food\">酥油茶：</span>分甜咸两种口味，可以试试<br>\n      <span class=\"food\">鸡豆凉粉：</span>口感爽滑细腻，既可以凉吃也可以热吃，凉粉上加入红辣椒、花椒、青葱酱醋等作料，很是美味<br>\n      <span class=\"food\">丽江粑粑：</span>加入火腿、油、糖等材料制成的盘子大小“千层饼”似的圆饼</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <h2>香格里拉</h2>\n      <p><span class=\"food\">糌粑：</span>它是青稞麦炒熟、磨细，不过筛的炒面<br>\n      <span class=\"food\">迪庆坨坨肉：</span>迪庆彝族的主要煮肉形式。将猪肉或羊、牛肉，不放佐料用冷水煮熟<br>\n      <span class=\"food\">奶渣：</span>奶渣从牛奶中提制而成，用酥油煎奶渣加红糖而成的煎奶渣是藏家人待客常用的一道菜<br>\n      <span class=\"food\">中甸酸奶：</span>用提炼过酥油的奶制作的，适合老人和小孩食用</p>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
